{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to become the Spider that hunts? Or the tiny insects that flee?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPIDER HOTEL is an asymmetrical 1 vs 4 multiplayer chase game. The insects cooperate to rescue allies and slip past traps to survive. The Spider races across walls and ceilings, wrapping prey in cocoons. Hunt\u2014or escape and endure. Let the chase begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/c5912c884afe51b16ed8cba279c88089.avif?t=1759475978\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four insects search for their missing friend. They are shadow-dwelling outcasts: a Fly, an Earwig, a Slug, and Gummy\u2014not the flashy beetles kids admire. Summoning their courage, they follow the clues into an aging hotel... where a Spider named Kandada awaits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival (Online 1 vs 4)</strong>: Runners and the Chaser fight the clock\u2014survive or capture before time runs out.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Match (Match with any players online.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private Match (Invite friends and play together.)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge (Solo Mini Games)</strong>: Single-player bite-sized trials. (Planned for full release)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROLES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runner (Insects / 4)</strong>: Rescue teammates and cooperate to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaser (Spider / 1)</strong>: Traverse walls and ceilings, approach from blind spots, and secure prey in cocoons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/d0875abe8d437e1826340a04d0b4c191.avif?t=1759475978\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zeb the Fly</strong> Freely darts through the air. Agile hit-and-run survival style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kafka the Earwig</strong> Cuts through anything. Balanced speed and striking power\u2014reliable backbone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Salt the Slug</strong> Crawls in pseudo zero-G on walls and ceilings. Stealth ability excels at rescue plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gummy</strong> A strange being spawning duplicates. Quirky but supports the team with unique utility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kandada the Spider</strong> A ruthless hunter ruling with silk. Stalks the dark and dominates by cocooning prey.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dim hotel halls, underground storage, a mysterious forest\u2014varied arenas built for multiplayer tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/58f30ffff2ec56a6987bbc6ad3f6fcb4.avif?t=1759475978\" width=788 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/51383003ff69fb6d7eec8fe1240e6e6f.avif?t=1759475978\" width=788 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RANKING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win matches to earn points and climb the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/fd15e6d8feed80d3bbe9b49f1682f6da.avif?t=1759475978\" width=778 height=280 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NAMEPLATE CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win matches to earn Amber. Trade Amber for items in the Store and customize your nameplate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/facc967f1b76fb1358993abee52c1efd.avif?t=1759475978\" width=778 height=280 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/2e3376dbf0e4e424cdf05a87a61969fd.avif?t=1759475978\" width=778 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/f639f2df39ba634a7e15439d261da2b3.avif?t=1759475978\" width=778 height=280 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648840?t=1759475978","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/e0c53f115202b657bd6a7a6c4eeb5654a4a51fb3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759475978","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/6cb12bc525ddb943132424ad55bdca06b9c1b30e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759475978","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/6cb12bc525ddb943132424ad55bdca06b9c1b30e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759475978","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3828380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to become the Spider that h